    {
      "id": "TxlY8CTkh9OHHMCZVl-yr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -255.79988438720704,
      "y": 1629.548529146126,
      "width": 744.6886813918653,
      "height": 418.35976445306767,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ap",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1222622315,
      "version": 625,
      "versionNonce": 1818607307,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Xwva9zsKJirK6J7KOLfqz",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791108808005,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In a town, there are n people labeled from 1 to n. There is a rumor that one\nof these people is secretly the town judge.\n\nIf the town judge exists, then:\n\nThe town judge trusts nobody.\nEverybody (except for the town judge) trusts the town judge.\nThere is exactly one person that satisfies properties 1 and 2.\nYou are given an array trust where trust[i] = [ai, bi] representing that the\nperson labeled ai trusts \nthe person labeled bi. If a trust relationship does not exist in trust array,\nthen such a trust relationship does not exist.\n\nReturn the label of the town judge if the town judge exists and can be\nidentified, or return -1 otherwise.\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 19.68751832720321,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In a town, there are n people labeled from 1 to n. There is a rumor that one of these people is secretly the town judge.\n\nIf the town judge exists, then:\n\nThe town judge trusts nobody.\nEverybody (except for the town judge) trusts the town judge.\nThere is exactly one person that satisfies properties 1 and 2.\nYou are given an array trust where trust[i] = [ai, bi] representing that the person labeled ai trusts \nthe person labeled bi. If a trust relationship does not exist in trust array, then such a trust relationship does not exist.\n\nReturn the label of the town judge if the town judge exists and can be identified, or return -1 otherwise.\n\n ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
